Looking at the comment: "If the index is valid, every element before the removed index remains unchanged after the removal."

- Index valid premise: `0 <= index && index < \old(this.size())`
- Elements before the removed index: indices `0` to `index-1`
- Unchanged: `this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i)))`

